From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:07:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: ahb: distribute data path ext_irq completion groups across secondary CPU cores

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

Distribute ext_irq completion interrupts across CPU1-3 to eliminate CPU0 thermal concentration (61C).

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/ahb.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/ahb.c
@@ -438,8 +438,10 @@
 	for (i = 0; i < ATH11K_EXT_IRQ_GRP_NUM_MAX; i++) {
 		struct ath11k_ext_irq_grp *irq_grp = &ab->ext_irq_grp[i];
 
-		for (j = 0; j < irq_grp->num_irq; j++)
+		for (j = 0; j < irq_grp->num_irq; j++) {
+			irq_set_affinity_hint(ab->irq_num[irq_grp->irqs[j]], NULL);
 			free_irq(ab->irq_num[irq_grp->irqs[j]], irq_grp);
+		}
 
 		netif_napi_del(&irq_grp->napi);
 		free_netdev(irq_grp->napi_ndev);
@@ -600,6 +602,14 @@
 			if (ret) {
 				ath11k_err(ab, "failed request_irq for %d\n",
 					   irq);
+			} else if (num_online_cpus() > 1) {
+				/* MAXNET Multicore SMP Balancing by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+				 * Distribute ext_irq data path completion groups across CPU1, CPU2, and CPU3
+				 * to eliminate CPU0 thermal concentration (61C) and balance NAPI softirq load.
+				 * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+				 */
+				int target_cpu = 1 + (i % (num_online_cpus() - 1));
+				irq_set_affinity_hint(irq, cpumask_of(target_cpu));
 			}
 		}
 	}
